        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of two-handled ovenproof pan of chicken and onion",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the HelloFresh recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "number": 2,
      "heading": "Bake the stew",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir in crème fraîche, stock paste, basil, tomatoes, {{sauce-sugar}} sugar and {{sauce-water}} water. Bring to a boil, cover the pan with foil and bake on the middle shelf 22–25 minutes until the chicken is cooked through with no pink in the middle."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
