    {
      "id": "step-5",
      "number": 5,
      "heading": "Pull the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "Remove the cooked stew from the oven. Add the spinach a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1–2 minutes. Break the chicken into smaller pieces with forks or a spoon. Stir in sun-dried tomato paste and cheese, season and loosen with a splash of water if needed."
      ],
